1
00:00:00,595 --> 00:00:02,635
(Sheldon:)and now you think you may
have lost her love forever.

2
00:00:02,797 --> 00:00:06,607
(Sheldon:)How does this compare to me being
forced to relax for a few days?

3
00:00:08,636 --> 00:00:10,976
-It doesn't!
-Thank you!

4
00:00:13,074 --> 00:00:14,554
(Leonard:)I'm gonna go talk to Penny.

5
00:00:14,709 --> 00:00:17,879
(Sheldon:)I'm going to go inside,
put on my coziest pajamas,

6
00:00:18,046 --> 00:00:21,586
(Sheldon:)curl up with a good book and wait
for this nightmare to be over.

7
00:00:25,620 --> 00:00:27,330
(Sheldon:)Penny.

8
00:00:33,161 --> 00:00:34,401
(Sheldon:)Sorry.

9
00:00:36,631 --> 00:00:37,671
(Sheldon:)-Hi.
-Hey.

10
00:00:37,832 --> 00:00:39,142
(Penny:)Look, I'm sorry I
didn't text you back.

11
00:00:39,300 --> 00:00:40,640
(Penny:)I just needed
some time to think.

12
00:00:40,802 --> 00:00:42,842
(Leonard:)-Okay.
-Here. Come in.

13
00:00:43,004 --> 00:00:44,914
(Leonard:)Look, if you want
to break up, just say it.

14
00:00:45,073 --> 00:00:46,343
(Sheldon:)-Leonard--
-No, no, no. I take it back.

15
00:00:46,507 --> 00:00:48,457
(Leonard:)Don't say it.
Just hate me, but stay with me.

16
00:00:48,610 --> 00:00:50,320
(Leonard:)It worked for my parents.

17
00:00:52,480 --> 00:00:55,120
(Penny:)Listen, I don't want
to break up with you.

18
00:00:55,850 --> 00:00:57,350
(Leonard:)Oh. Okay.

19
00:00:58,186 --> 00:00:59,526
(Leonard:)Good, good.

20
00:00:59,687 --> 00:01:03,027
(Leonard:)So it's cool if I cry a little?

